OL,3,GNEWSAScrap first class on trains, say
OL,4,Acouncillors
OL,5,
OL,6,FOpposition politicians are urging rail
OL,7,Fbosses to scrap first-class rail
OL,8,Ftickets on rush-hour services.
OL,10,FLiberal Democrats on Stevenage Borough
OL,11,FCouncil say the move would reduce
OL,12,Fovercrowding on Thameslink and Great
OL,13,FNorthern trains.
OL,15,FOne of the services operated by
OL,16,FThameslink was named the most
OL,17,Fovercrowded in the country earlier this
OL,18,Fyear.
